  actor: jgstern_agent  # ca07
  clock: 2  # ca07
  nonce: ca07  # ca07
  message: "Bakeoff finding: For framework-heavy repos like netty, direct stdlib IO calls represent <1% of edges even with perfect detection. Most IO flows through framework abstractions (Channel.write, ByteBuf.readBytes). Adding framework methods to IO catalogs would significantly improve IO tag rates. Target frameworks: Netty (Channel, ByteBuf, ChannelHandlerContext), Spring (RestTemplate, WebClient), OkHttp (Call.execute)."  # ca07
